blocks.zh:
总之,我们的贡献有三:
1) 我们引入了一个Ego-Action-World互动框架,它有四个互补的结构——节点、边缘、链条和环圈——以便系统地捕捉以自我为中心的理解的各个方面;
2) 我们将这一框架作为EgoOmniWorld进行即时分析,这是一个24,166个以实例为基础的基准,用互动第一数据引擎构建,涵盖不同的能力范围、模式要求和评价格式;
3)我们证明"EgoOmniWorld"既是统一的诊断试验台,也是自我中心视频理解的可转移监督来源.

blocks.en:
Egocentric Video Benchmarks. A growing body of egocentric video benchmarks has explored increasingly diverse aspects of first-person understanding.
EgoSchema Mangalam et al. [2023] and EgoTempo Plizzari et al. [2025a] emphasize long-horizon and temporal reasoning;
EgoTaskQA Jia et al. [2022] studies task-oriented understanding, including action dependencies and goal-related reasoning;
EgoToM Li et al. [2025] focuses on reasoning about the wearer’s mental states, goals, and actions;
and MultiHop-EgoQA Chen et al. [2025] targets multi-hop reasoning across temporally distributed evidence.
Other benchmarks, e.g., EgoCross Li et al. [2026] , EgoNight Zhang et al. [2026] , and EgoTextVQA Zhou et al. [2025] have explored complementary aspects such as cross-domain generalization, nighttime understanding, and scene-text understanding.

